WEBVTT

00:15:30.766 --> 00:15:33.010
(Applause)

00:15:33.034 --> 00:15:37.620
JT: Ohhhh. What was that?

00:15:37.644 --> 00:15:39.891
Circus, rock 'n' roll, drama.

00:15:39.915 --> 00:15:42.733
What the hell are we doing
up there on that stage?

00:15:42.757 --> 00:15:45.395
Well, one last story, very quickly.

00:15:45.419 --> 00:15:48.265
After I was in that village,
I crossed the lake,

00:15:48.289 --> 00:15:51.354
and I saw that the volcano was erupting

00:15:51.378 --> 00:15:53.107
on the other side, Gunung Batur,

00:15:53.131 --> 00:15:56.192
and there was a dead volcano
next to the live volcano.

00:15:56.216 --> 00:15:58.455
I didn't think I'd be
swallowed by the volcano,

00:15:58.479 --> 00:15:59.799
and I am here.

00:15:59.823 --> 00:16:03.736
But it's very easy to climb up, is it not?